{"t":"Goblin Temple Quest","s":"goblin-temple-quest-fb342","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Goblin_Temple_Quest_Map_1_ad8545.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Goblin Temple Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Rookgaard Goblin Quest/Temple of Cheese Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"timealloc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Length</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5-10 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(6 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>...\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblin</a> Temple\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Trolls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Spearman\">Orcs Spearman</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaur</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wasp\">Wasp</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>50  gp, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Snowball\">Snowballs</a>, 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stones</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sandals\">Sandals</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pan\">Pan</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Assuming you have a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">shovel</a>, go to Rookgaard's premium troll cave (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32001,32213,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32001, 32213, 7)</a>). Once you are down, follow the map.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Goblin Temple Quest Map 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"177\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Temple_Quest_Map_1_ad8545.png\" width=\"590\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Once there, head straight south, you'll run into trolls and orcs before the bridge, once at the bridge, hurry across, the goblins <i>will</i> shoot you with stones. Once across you'll see a staircase going down, down there are goblins (note they can melee you as well as throw stones), kill them or just run, then follow the map again. Once you go down you will face 3 goblins and on the northern side there will be 3 other goblins trapped which you can only kill with <a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\">spears</a> or with <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stones</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Goblin Temple Quest Map 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"214\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Temple_Quest_Map_2_cc950c.png\" width=\"551\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>You'll see a staircase to a higher level, upstairs are 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">goblins</a>, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">minotaur</a>, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Spearman\">Orc Spearman</a>, 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Wasp\">wasp</a> , kill all and search the chests for your reward.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Note</b>: Before the Winter Update 2007, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pan\">pan</a> could be traded with <a href=\"#/wiki/Billy\">Billy</a> for an antidote rune, now he gives you a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Health%20Potion\">Small Health Potion</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["small-health-potion-quest"]}